      "text": "increased by 8.5 percent in nominal Interest payments 3.8 4.7 4.6\nterms (or by 0.1 percentage points of Fuel subsidy 1/ 0.0 0.5 0.0\nauthorities’ projected GDP). This increase\naccommodates higher spending of Overall balance -3.5 -3.8 -4.1\n"
